eration":"20260827124955","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-1n.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-1n[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Make the bobs-org/bob GitHub repo the only Bob vault sync channel[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The Bob Obsidian vault stays converged between athena and the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]MacBook through git alone, driven by a new `bob vault-sync` command[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]that pulls, merges, commits, and pushes unattended without ever [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]leaving conflict markers or a halted merge; Obsidian Sync is [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]switched off on both devices; and large PDF trees that must not [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]enter the repo reach the MacBook over an explicit rsync bridge [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]invoked by a new configurable `bob highlights` pre-scan command.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]vault_git_sync.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/vault_git_sync.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-1n[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-1n/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Converge both vaults and fix what the first `git add -A` would[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]sweep in[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]reconcile[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reconcile: back up both vaults, close the five remaining athena/MacBook [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]differences, gitignore `lit_review/` and `xlib/`, add `.gitattributes`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]run `git gc`, and land the 206-path commit backlog so both machines [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]start from one known SHA.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Implement `bob vault-sync` and its conflict-copy policy[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]vaultsync[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vaultsync: add the `bob vault-sync run|status` subcommand implementing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the lock-protected reconcile cycle, quarantined conflict copies under [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`_conflicts/`, the 95 MiB preflight guard, interrupted-merge recovery, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and a machine-readable status record.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Retire `bulk-git-commit` and rewire `bob nightly`[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]retire[dim] · [dim][/dim]after vaultsync[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retire: delete the `bulk-git-commit` subcommand and its `bob_sync` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]script and binary aliases, drop the `ob sync` gate from `bob nightly`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and make nightly run vault-sync, move-done-tasks, vault-sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add a configurable pre-scan command to `bob highlights`[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]highlights[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]highlights: teach `bob highlights scan` to run a configured command [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]before it inspects the library, wired through `~/.config/bob/config.yml`[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and an environment override, so an off-band PDF bridge can deliver [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`xlib/` intake.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Provision credentials, triggers, and the MacBook git clone[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]machines[dim] · [dim][/dim]after reconcile, retire, highlights[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]machines: create a passphraseless deploy key for athena, add SSH [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ControlMaster, ship the chezmoi rsync bridge and config, convert the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]MacBook's `~/bob` into a clone in place, and install the systemd and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]launchd triggers without enabling them.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prove the acceptance matrix end to end, then cut over[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cutover[dim] · [dim][/dim]after machines[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cutover: run every acceptance test across both real machines, disable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Obsidian Sync on athena and the MacBook, restore nightly maintenance, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]write the runbook, and supersede the competing Obsidian Sync restoration[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]epic.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-1n","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-1n.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ad1f4fc1d1e24cb2f11a9baa6f2374ec","started_at":"2026-08-27T16:50:23.539738+00:00","state":"active"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1787850241,"sha":"86bff4105b7ac7de2d8b60d4b2241ff3204db9b9","subject":"feat(highlights): add scan pre-scan hook"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"344f1345f0d199e1cb1b90cb435ae8c4ab7b13efb9bec1ced33a5a0ac992dcd8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-1n.4/commits.json","size_bytes":218},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de5